<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;AMIRA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Amira is a curious and intrepid traveler exploring the town of Menzel Bourguiba and investigating the twin town connection."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MENZEL BOURGUIBA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Menzel Bourguiba is a Tunisian town known for its rich history and vibrant culture, where Amira is exploring and discovering the twin town connection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Menzel Bourguiba is a city that has engaged in trade and investment with Stuttgart through the twinning agreement."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TWIN TOWN: BERANE, MONTENEGRO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Twin Town event is a connection between Menzel Bourguiba and Berane, Montenegro, established through a twinning ceremony."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BERANE, MONTENEGRO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Berane, Montenegro is a municipality in northeastern Montenegro connected to Menzel Bourguiba through a twinning agreement."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MONSIEUR BEN ALI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Monsieur Ben Ali is the local mayor of Menzel Bourguiba who provides information about the twinning ceremony and subsequent exchanges."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DRAGAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dragan is the mayor of Berane, Montenegro, who participated in the twinning ceremony with Menzel Bourguiba."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TWINNING CEREMONY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Twinning Ceremony is a formal event held in Menzel Bourguiba involving the mayor of Berane and a delegation from Montenegro."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STUTTGART&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Stuttgart is a German city that has been twinned with Menzel Bourguiba since 1964, fostering a strong bond between the two cities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stuttgart is a city that has engaged in trade and investment with Menzel Bourguiba through the twinning agreement."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRITZ KUHN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fritz Kuhn is the Mayor of Stuttgart, expressing pride in the city's partnership with Menzel Bourguiba."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF APPLIED SCIENCES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of Applied Sciences in Stuttgart has established partnerships with Menzel Bourguiba's University of Tunis."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. AMEL BEN ABDA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Amel Ben Abda is the Dean of the University of Tunis, highlighting the benefits of the educational exchange program."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF TUNIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of Tunis has partnered with Stuttgart's University of Applied Sciences for student and faculty exchange programs."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MENZEL BOURGUIBA'S MAYOR, MOHAMED ALI BOUAZIZI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mohamed Ali Bouazizi is the Mayor of Menzel Bourguiba, emphasizing the importance of the twinning agreement for infrastructure development."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GERMAN-TUNISIAN CHAMBER OF INDUSTRY AND COMMERCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The German-Tunisian Chamber of Industry and Commerce provides data on the twinning agreement and its economic impacts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The German-Tunisian Chamber of Industry and Commerce tracks trade and investment data between Stuttgart and Menzel Bourguiba."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DARBUKA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Darbuka is a traditional Tunisian drum used in the cultural exchange between Menzel Bourguiba and Berane."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRILLED MEATS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Grilled Meats represent the traditional cuisine shared during the cultural exchange between Menzel Bourguiba and Berane."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MINT TEA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mint Tea is a traditional beverage enjoyed during meetings and social gatherings in Menzel Bourguiba."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ARABIC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LANGUAGE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Arabic is a language studied by students from Berane in Menzel Bourguiba as part of the cultural exchange."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TUNISIAN HISTORY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tunisian History is a subject taught at the University of Tunis and studied by students from Stuttgart."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENGINEERING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Engineering is a field of expertise shared between Stuttgart and Menzel Bourguiba, particularly in green technology and sustainable urban development."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TECHNOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Technology is a focus area of cooperation between Stuttgart and Menzel Bourguiba, including green technology and sustainable urban development."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;URBAN PLANNING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Urban Planning is an area of collaboration between Stuttgart and Menzel Bourguiba, aimed at modernizing infrastructure and reducing carbon footprints."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL SUSTAINABILITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Environmental Sustainability is a key focus of the partnership between Stuttgart and Menzel Bourguiba, promoting green technology and sustainable practices."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TWINNING AGREEMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The twinning agreement has led to increased trade and investment between Stuttgart and Menzel Bourguiba."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STUTTGART-BASED COMPANIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Stuttgart-based companies have invested heavily in Tunisia's manufacturing and tourism sectors."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TUNISIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tunisia is the country where Menzel Bourguiba and Stuttgart-based companies have invested in manufacturing and tourism sectors."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MANUFACTURING SECTOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The manufacturing sector is one of the areas where Stuttgart-based companies have invested in Tunisia."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOURISM SECTOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The tourism sector is another area where Stuttgart-based companies have invested in Tunisia."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2020&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TIME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"2020 is the year when bilateral trade between Stuttgart and Menzel Bourguiba reached €15 million."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0440</data>
    </node>
